      "Criterion 6 assessment: Testing notes: Point 132047153 has no returned average Signal Strength, Signal Quality or SNR values and no corresponding summary rows. A genuine Automobile Download fixture returning all three averages is required to verify their presence and order; missing values are not classified as a product failure.",
      "Criterion 8 assessment: SIMULATED UI STATE: Delayed the selected detail request to check loading. Criterion-owned The evidence establishes the genuine starting record, The evidence the closed-panel transition, The evidence visibly shows the loading message/progress bar without stale analysis, and The evidence shows the recovered chart.",
      "Criterion 9 assessment: Testing notes: A genuine POST /api/platform/automobile/download/test-analysis for point 132047153 returned 200 with 121 samples and a populated chart. No actual unavailable response or project-documented empty-response contract was supplied/established. Emptying a successful response would invent the contract, so no no-data simulation was performed. An authoritative empty-response contract or genuine unavailable fixture is required. The supplied sources establish no empty-response contract, and this inspected record is available. Recorded the missing unavailable-data prerequisite; did not simulate an invented empty response.",
      "Criterion 10 assessment: SIMULATED UI STATE: Returned HTTP 503 for the selected detail request to check error handling. The evidence shows target 132047153 at 24.12 Mbps with the error, Retry and no stale chart/table;"
